WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.680
Where do people go? If you're moved on from everywhere, there is

2
00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:06.729
nowhere to be. Death from homelessness.

3
00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:11.460
Caitlin died at 47, ill, rundown, and fatigued after

4
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.600
having to sleep outside in Christchurch in late autumn

5
00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:18.400
2025 from two respiratory infections,

6
00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:21.500
including the common cold because of her lifelong

7
00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.660
immunosuppression to prevent her kidney transplant rejecting.

8
00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:29.400
Caitlin's previous hospital renal specialist concluded in his report I

9
00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:33.400
provided the coroner, "With suitable and stable housing, Caitlin should

10
00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:36.740
