36
00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:07.440
marginalization and stigma, loneliness,

37
00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:10.961
violence, and adverse living conditions.

38
00:02:11.021 --> 00:02:14.400
That's what the move on orders will do even more.

39
00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:18.260
MSD refused Caitlin housing.

40
00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:22.970
Caitlin was not provided a permanent home, despite MSD

41
00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:27.200
