43
00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:36.120
I am now walking in Caitlin's shoes, experiencing the same rejection and

44
00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:40.100
runaround, showing how difficult it is to navigate a fragmented,

45
00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:44.180
unresponsive, and unaccountable system, then and

46
00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:48.080
