or life of the applicant."

54
00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:17.400
Public Trust then rejected her GP certification in February

55
00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:21.400
2025 that Caitlin was at serious and imminent risk of

56
00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:25.260
death to enable her to withdraw her $48,000

57
00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:29.100
KiwiSaver to be safely housed and cared for without

58
00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:30.900
taking any medical advice at all.

59
00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:35.700
She was found dead three months later after having to sleep outside in late

60
00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:36.120
autumn.

61
00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:40.980
Move on orders push homeless people to the margins away from

62
