76
00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:34.360
Police did not even ensure she was safe when assisting her to leave yet another

77
00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:38.020
unsuitable place with a 24 hours safety order the

78
00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:41.840
