Housing Need, a joined up government response is essential to make real

88
00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:13.860
progress in reducing the extent of homelessness and unstable housing.

89
00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:17.340
The proposed move on orders do the opposite.

90
00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:20.700
A duty to assist is needed instead.

91
00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:24.900
We need an integrated approach, listening to those who know,

92
00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:27.760
across party and across government.

93
00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:30.920
To end,

94
00:05:32.420 --> 00:05:34.160
my beautiful daughter.

95
00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:38.400
To end, Caitlin was my beautiful daughter.

96
