Caitlin could be your daughter.

97
00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:43.500
She could be your sister,

98
00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:46.520
your friend, your cousin, your aunt.

99
00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:48.880
This could happen to any of us.

100
00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:53.080
Housing is a human right: decent, warm,

101
00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:55.260
