00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:27.699
Sumval, and I speak to you today to strongly oppose this move on a dispell.

363
00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:32.420
I really feel it is the most disgusting and depraved thing those of you in the

364
00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:35.740
coalition have produced. And I thank the members of this committee who are going to

365
00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:37.540
