366
00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:42.040
I live, work, and study in the beautiful Te Whanganui-a-Tara, Wellington.

367
00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:45.520
Unlike some of yourselves who get around in Ubers and private cars, I actually walk

368
00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:48.840
and bus around this city, so I come into daily contact with the people who are

369
00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:52.380
going to be affected by this bill. These are people you have abandoned,

370
00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:56.700
mischaracterized, disrespected, and who you finally seek to subject to the

371
00:20:56.760 --> 00:21:00.429
further indignity and violence of harassment, relocation, and

372
00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:01.120
imprisonment.

373
00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:05.480
The other day, I spoke to a man who was committing what under this bill would be

374
00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:06.720
the crime of begging.

375
00:21:08.020 --> 00:21:11.980
I'd given him $20, and he asked if I was a Christian.

376
00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:15.880
I said that I wasn't, and he said that I must just be a person with heart.

377
00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:19.860
He said the world was broken, and I agreed.

378
00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:24.580
I remembered seeing this guy on the night of the terrible floods in Wellington

379
00:21:24.620 --> 00:21:25.520
earlier this year.

380
00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:30.260
My friends had lost their home and many of their precious belongings in this flood.

381
00:21:30.840 --> 00:21:34.160
And as this news was coming to me, I sat horrified on their behalf.

382
00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:38.630
But also, as a citizen of Wellington, I was also increasingly thinking about what

383
00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:42.540
would be happening to all the people who had less, those who slept in the street.

384
00:21:43.720 --> 00:21:45.640
What were you thinking about on that day,

385
00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:49.360
you who are paid to represent all of us in Aotearoa?

386
00:21:50.520 --> 00:21:54.420
What would you do if you saw this guy sitting in soaking wet clothes in

387
00:21:54.460 --> 00:21:56.360
