388
00:21:57.860 --> 00:22:00.520
How would you feel if it was you sitting there?

389
00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:03.700
Are you capable of such a basic empathetic response?

390
00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:08.440
Or would you identify with the people who would turn up their nose at him, who

391
00:22:08.460 --> 00:22:09.360
