00:25:41.982 --> 00:25:44.232
Please do just leave some time for questions. Over to you.

458
00:25:45.412 --> 00:25:48.472
Sure. So I'm going to talk briefly about the general concerns with the bill and

459
00:25:48.512 --> 00:25:52.472
