On the way, he was attacked by robbers.

2338
03:11:49.876 --> 03:11:53.656
They took his clothes, they beat him up, and they went off, leaving him

2339
03:11:53.736 --> 03:11:57.276
half dead in the city. Luckily, a member of

2340
03:11:57.296 --> 03:12:01.276
parliament was on his way down the same road, but when he saw him, he

2341
03:12:01.316 --> 03:12:01.915
moved him on.

2342
03:12:02.836 --> 03:12:04.256
Then a member of parliament showed up.

2343
03:12:04.316 --> 03:12:08.196
Again, he also moved him on. A gang member

2344
03:12:08.256 --> 03:12:12.176
traveling the road came on him. When he saw the man's condition, his

2345
03:12:12.236 --> 03:12:15.876
heart went out to him. He gave him first aid, disinfecting and

2346
03:12:15.916 --> 03:12:19.456
bandaging his wounds. Then he lifted him into his ute, led him to an

2347
03:12:19.536 --> 03:12:22.896
Airbnb and made him comfortable. In the morning, he took out

2348
03:12:22.916 --> 03:12:26.545
$1,000," don't know where he got it, "and gave it to the owner, saying,

2349
03:12:26.716 --> 03:12:30.436
'Take good care of him. If it costs any more, put it on my bill.

2350
03:12:30.816 --> 03:12:34.396
I'll pay you on my way back.' What do you think?

2351
03:12:34.436 --> 03:12:37.656
Which of the three became a neighbor to the man attacked by the robbers?"

2352
03:12:38.506 --> 03:12:41.376
"The one who treated him kindly," the religious leader said.

2353
03:12:41.896 --> 03:12:43.756
Jesus said, "Go and do the same."

2354
03:12:45.116 --> 03:12:45.396
Thank you.

2355
