2393
03:14:51.236 --> 03:14:51.656
Thank you.

2394
03:14:52.296 --> 03:14:52.776
Fantastic.

2395
03:14:53.656 --> 03:14:57.296
Thank you both for your submission and for joining us this evening as well.

2396
03:14:57.326 --> 03:14:57.406
Thank you.

2397
03:14:57.406 --> 03:14:57.716
Thank you.

